Based on SceneDesignerAgent's sandbox report, I have all the information needed to design the milestone. The blast furnace is placed at spawn-relative coordinates (0, 1, 10) — center of the back wall inside the stone brick building. The task is "find blast_furnace" which is an observation/locate task.

```json
